  "name": "filter-core",
  "type": "registry:lib",
  "title": "Filter Core",
  "description": "Dependency-free filter model for Dethink filter surfaces: a serializable AND/OR filter tree with negation; typed text, number, date, boolean, option and multi-option operators; relative dates stored relative and resolved per time zone as calendar days (DST-safe); custom field types and operators; group commands with a shared depth limit; validation; a compiled row predicate; facet, impact and empty-result rescue counts; a TanStack adapter; readable sentences and membership-aware diffs; a text query syntax (field:value, lists, negation, comparisons, ranges, relative dates, AND/OR with parentheses) with a hand-written parser that reports exact error ranges, a canonical printer that round-trips, token highlighting and autocomplete suggestions, and id reconciliation for rebuilt filters; and a versioned URL codec (readable ?q=\u2026&v=\u2026 params, fieldsAt/migrate upgrades for renamed fields, renameFilterField).",
